
 Oakleaf is an implementation of robust statistical methods in Fortran

 Documentation can be found in doc/ as well as at

    https://integral.physics.muni.cz/oakleaf/


 BUILD


$ autoreconf -i -f
$ ./configure FCFLAGS="-std=f2008 -Wall -g -p -no-pie -fcheck=all -fimplicit-none -fbacktrace -ffpe-trap=invalid,zero,overflow -fno-unsafe-math-optimizations -frounding-math -fsignaling-nans" --prefix=/scratch/opt
$ make
# make install
